{"id": null, "n": "0091002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0091002", "type": "mod", "text": "〔－〕【CB】【卍續-CB】【考偽-大】，（頓悟…是）二十一字【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0099001", "type": "mod", "text": "萬【CB】【卍續-CB】，力【大】，万【考偽-大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0112001", "type": "mod", "text": "增【大】下同，憎【考偽-大】下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】承應二年刊宗教大學藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091002", "type": "orig", "text": "〔頓悟…是〕二十一字－？"}
